# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Fiches & Cloud — Git ignore rules
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Firebase configuration
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IMPORTANT: `src/env-config.js` is intentionally NOT ignored — it must be
# committed so the static site can load its config when hosted on GitHub Pages.
# Values inside it are Base64-encoded. Firebase *web* API keys are public by
# design; real access control lives in the Firestore rules + Firebase Auth.
#
# A local scratch override you never want to publish:
src/env-config.local.js
.env
.env.*

